# Sort canonical-combining runs in linear time instead of a quadratic bubble sort.
# author: Rohit Goswami (HaoZeke)
# Upstream commit: https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/6b505d1f41f8f3ea0fe5a4786d3a8fff1875cfc0

